(2449115, 337310, 3087, '<td valign="top">"We have found a witch. May we burn her?"<br/>"Burn her! Burn! Burn her! Burn her!"<br/>"How do you know she''s a witch?"<br/>"She looks like one!"<br/>"Bring her forward."<br/>"I''m not a witch. I''m not a witch."<br/>"Uh, but you are dressed as one."<br/>"They dressed me up like this."<br/>"Augh, we didn''t! We didn''t..."<br/>"And this isn''t my nose. It''s a false one."<br/>"Well?"<br/>"Well, we did do the nose."<br/>"The nose?"<br/>"And the hat, but she is a witch!"<br/>"Did you dress her up like this?"<br/>"No! No. No. No. No. No."<br/>"Yes. Yeah, a bit."<br/>"She has got a wart."<br/>...<br/>"Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! There are ways of telling whether she is a witch."<br/>"So, why do witches burn?"<br/>"B--... ''cause they''re made of... wood?"<br/>"Good! Heh heh."<br/>"So, how do we tell whether she is made of wood?"<br/>...<br/>"If... she... weighs... the same as a duck,... she''s made of wood."<br/>"And therefore?"<br/>"A witch! A witch!..."<br/>"Here is a duck. Use this duck."<br/> <br/>etc. etc.<br/> <br/>Love this, very funny!</td>', '"We have found a witch. May we burn her?""Burn her! Burn! Burn her! Burn her!""How do you know she''s a witch?""She looks like one!""Bring her forward.""I''m not a witch. I''m not a witch.""Uh, but you are dressed as one.""They dressed me up like this.""Augh, we didn''t! We didn''t...""And this isn''t my nose. It''s a false one.""Well?""Well, we did do the nose.""The nose?""And the hat, but she is a witch!""Did you dress her up like this?""No! No. No. No. No. No.""Yes. Yeah, a bit.""She has got a wart."..."Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! Quiet! There are ways of telling whether she is a witch.""So, why do witches burn?""B--... ''cause they''re made of... wood?""Good! Heh heh.""So, how do we tell whether she is made of wood?"..."If... she... weighs... the same as a duck,... she''s made of wood.""And therefore?""A witch! A witch!...""Here is a duck. Use this duck." etc. etc. Love this, very funny!', '2006-05-23 08:47:59.000000', NULL, 1),
