(2449152, 337394, 387, '<td valign="top">This is the 107th photo I''ve voted on and it''s the first one I actually *liked*. I didn''t score it very high simply because when I look at it I don''t see anything that cries out heat. The word heat is in the title but the image doesn''t convey it. If there were perspiration on the subject''s forehead and shirt I would have scored it a ten. The black shirts could have shown the perspiration well, too. Excellent photograph anyway. It really tells a story.</td>', 'This is the 107th photo I''ve voted on and it''s the first one I actually *liked*. I didn''t score it very high simply because when I look at it I don''t see anything that cries out heat. The word heat is in the title but the image doesn''t convey it. If there were perspiration on the subject''s forehead and shirt I would have scored it a ten. The black shirts could have shown the perspiration well, too. Excellent photograph anyway. It really tells a story.', '2006-05-23 09:11:59.000000', NULL, 1),
