(2449314, 337445, 50034, '<td valign="top">Agreed!<br/>  Great concept!  However, the "punch" of the photo may have been better with fewer items in a supporting role.  They appear to be doing what Kathy Najimy did in Sister Act, they are acting as a "Scene-Stealer."  Of course, narrowing the DOF could also give subjective contrast sufficient to place them back into the true supportive role.  Still as is this photo garners a 9 from me.</td>', 'Agreed!  Great concept!  However, the "punch" of the photo may have been better with fewer items in a supporting role.  They appear to be doing what Kathy Najimy did in Sister Act, they are acting as a "Scene-Stealer."  Of course, narrowing the DOF could also give subjective contrast sufficient to place them back into the true supportive role.  Still as is this photo garners a 9 from me.', '2006-05-23 10:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
