(2449496, 336900, 51538, '<td valign="top">When I was growing up in Australia, we had a cat who would literally climb into the wood fire we had in the living room at the end of the evening and sleep on the warm embers.  One side of the cat was almost devoid of fur.</td>', 'When I was growing up in Australia, we had a cat who would literally climb into the wood fire we had in the living room at the end of the evening and sleep on the warm embers.  One side of the cat was almost devoid of fur.', '2006-05-23 11:34:18.000000', NULL, 1),
