(2450213, 337421, 42495, '<td valign="top">I sure hope you didn''t have to kill too many baseballs for the effect!  Clever idea and well executed.</td>', 'I sure hope you didn''t have to kill too many baseballs for the effect!  Clever idea and well executed.', '2006-05-23 16:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
