(2452776, 336933, 43565, '<td valign="top">I find the yellow distracting, and having a yellow border only makes the flower in the background stand out more.  This doesn''t say "heat" to me.  I think I would like it better if the front dandelion was against a solid background.</td>', 'I find the yellow distracting, and having a yellow border only makes the flower in the background stand out more.  This doesn''t say "heat" to me.  I think I would like it better if the front dandelion was against a solid background.', '2006-05-24 11:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
