(2455882, 337421, 44611, '<td valign="top">Great capture of fire - I hope this does well for you.</td>', 'Great capture of fire - I hope this does well for you.', '2006-05-25 07:54:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455883, 337059, 44611, '<td valign="top">Don''t they just love to do this!   Good clear shot and a sweet kitty.</td>', 'Don''t they just love to do this!   Good clear shot and a sweet kitty.', '2006-05-25 07:55:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455885, 337236, 44611, '<td valign="top">The capture of the milk drop is super and I love the red cup.  If I have one gripe about this it''s that the crop is rather tight - emphasised by the fact that the steam goes out of the image.  Still, one of the better shots in this challenge and I hope it does well for you.</td>', 'The capture of the milk drop is super and I love the red cup.  If I have one gripe about this it''s that the crop is rather tight - emphasised by the fact that the steam goes out of the image.  Still, one of the better shots in this challenge and I hope it does well for you.', '2006-05-25 07:56:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455887, 336900, 44611, '<td valign="top">I like the overall feel of this shot and the lighting, although I think the lighting on the cat could be a tad brighter.  Overall a good composition and the whole thing conveys warmth to me.</td>', 'I like the overall feel of this shot and the lighting, although I think the lighting on the cat could be a tad brighter.  Overall a good composition and the whole thing conveys warmth to me.', '2006-05-25 07:59:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455888, 335959, 44611, '<td valign="top">A well captured moment.  Good that we can see the smoke, but would have been even better if there were flames or embers (which I wouldn''t wish on anyone''s property).  Perhaps if the shot had included more fire fighting equipment/uniform the message would have been stronger.  Nonetheless a good image and worth a good score.</td>', 'A well captured moment.  Good that we can see the smoke, but would have been even better if there were flames or embers (which I wouldn''t wish on anyone''s property).  Perhaps if the shot had included more fire fighting equipment/uniform the message would have been stronger.  Nonetheless a good image and worth a good score.', '2006-05-25 08:02:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455889, 337392, 44611, '<td valign="top">Terrific sharpness on the match.</td>', 'Terrific sharpness on the match.', '2006-05-25 08:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2455890, 337296, 44611, '<td valign="top">Good creative take on the subject and good composition.  One of my top scoring images in the challenge although I would perhaps have liked to see slightly brighter lighting.</td>', 'Good creative take on the subject and good composition.  One of my top scoring images in the challenge although I would perhaps have liked to see slightly brighter lighting.', '2006-05-25 08:05:21.000000', NULL, 1),
