(2456610, 337328, 35804, '<td valign="top">By FAR the most impressive flame image in the challenge!I love that we get just a hint of the cook and the kitchen...I also love the fact that this is not in screeching color, again just the slightest hint of color...fantastic work!</td>', 'By FAR the most impressive flame image in the challenge!I love that we get just a hint of the cook and the kitchen...I also love the fact that this is not in screeching color, again just the slightest hint of color...fantastic work!', '2006-05-25 13:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456616, 337254, 35804, '<td valign="top">Tastefully sensual...beautifully done.</td>', 'Tastefully sensual...beautifully done.', '2006-05-25 13:59:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456619, 337368, 35804, '<td valign="top">Most excellent light and tones...has a great menacing vibe about it.</td>', 'Most excellent light and tones...has a great menacing vibe about it.', '2006-05-25 14:00:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456626, 337394, 35804, '<td valign="top">Simple...in your face...no pretense...it is what it is, 6 guy on a hot day....excellent shot.</td>', 'Simple...in your face...no pretense...it is what it is, 6 guy on a hot day....excellent shot.', '2006-05-25 14:02:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456634, 337313, 59564, '<td valign="top">A great shot!  Composition is great and really conveys a feeling of anger or frustration.</td>', 'A great shot!  Composition is great and really conveys a feeling of anger or frustration.', '2006-05-25 14:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456689, 337499, 45790, '<td valign="top">Perhaps a white balance problem, but I''d expect the burners to be more red. These seem to be pink with a hint of blue.</td>', 'Perhaps a white balance problem, but I''d expect the burners to be more red. These seem to be pink with a hint of blue.', '2006-05-25 14:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456694, 337224, 45790, '<td valign="top">That''s one ugly fire danger sign you found! Looks a bit overexposed. Did you desaturate the green to make the red stand out, or is it really that dry?</td>', 'That''s one ugly fire danger sign you found! Looks a bit overexposed. Did you desaturate the green to make the red stand out, or is it really that dry?', '2006-05-25 14:26:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456697, 337134, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great composition and I love the colors. Hope you do well.</td>', 'Great composition and I love the colors. Hope you do well.', '2006-05-25 14:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456702, 337360, 45790, '<td valign="top">Funniest take I''ve seen on that warning message. Well done shot -- you really captured those flames.</td>', 'Funniest take I''ve seen on that warning message. Well done shot -- you really captured those flames.', '2006-05-25 14:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456706, 337102, 45790, '<td valign="top">Very effective, convincing "heat" shot.</td>', 'Very effective, convincing "heat" shot.', '2006-05-25 14:30:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456712, 337078, 45790, '<td valign="top">I love the range of colors you''ve got in this one. Normally I''d complain about it being oversaturated, but it works well artistically here. I''d change the crop slightly to get rid of whatever-it-is at the bottom of the image.</td>', 'I love the range of colors you''ve got in this one. Normally I''d complain about it being oversaturated, but it works well artistically here. I''d change the crop slightly to get rid of whatever-it-is at the bottom of the image.', '2006-05-25 14:32:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456716, 337403, 45790, '<td valign="top">Title is a great play on words and an excellent shot as well!</td>', 'Title is a great play on words and an excellent shot as well!', '2006-05-25 14:33:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456722, 336789, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good job with the lighting. Symmetry works well here.</td>', 'Good job with the lighting. Symmetry works well here.', '2006-05-25 14:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456747, 337411, 45790, '<td valign="top">While I can see the reason for her being dirty with ashes, and the photo is very effective, I think I''d prefer it if she were clean.</td>', 'While I can see the reason for her being dirty with ashes, and the photo is very effective, I think I''d prefer it if she were clean.', '2006-05-25 14:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456756, 336923, 45790, '<td valign="top">Like that composition but the image isn''t sharp. Those peppers should be vibrant and attacking the viewer!</td>', 'Like that composition but the image isn''t sharp. Those peppers should be vibrant and attacking the viewer!', '2006-05-25 14:39:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456758, 337158, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good, simple, uncluttered illustration of heat. Negative space works very well.</td>', 'Good, simple, uncluttered illustration of heat. Negative space works very well.', '2006-05-25 14:41:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456762, 337319, 45790, '<td valign="top">Good use of silhouette. Clever use of two sources of "heat".</td>', 'Good use of silhouette. Clever use of two sources of "heat".', '2006-05-25 14:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456767, 336933, 45790, '<td valign="top">I think the heat is over in this reproductive process! I would have concentrated on just one dandelion and tried to clear out most of the background -- there is just too much clutter.</td>', 'I think the heat is over in this reproductive process! I would have concentrated on just one dandelion and tried to clear out most of the background -- there is just too much clutter.', '2006-05-25 14:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2456773, 334978, 45790, '<td valign="top">Great composition -- it looks like the airplane is flying into the sun. Only flaw are the halos around airplane -- too much sharpening.</td>', 'Great composition -- it looks like the airplane is flying into the sun. Only flaw are the halos around airplane -- too much sharpening.', '2006-05-25 14:50:29.000000', NULL, 1),
