(2463646, 337336, 16912, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this shot (3rd visit) the more I like it. There has been talk in the forums recently about dpc ''colours'' and imho this is an example of what they mean, I can easily see this sitting with a ribbon next to it. The angle used is inspired and I''m constantly drawn to the end of the pier then up to the sun down the rails and ready to start again with the left hand rails keeping me in the frame. The light on the floorboards is fantastic.<br/> <br/>ok, am starting to ramble, good luck (bumping up 1)</td>', 'The more I look at this shot (3rd visit) the more I like it. There has been talk in the forums recently about dpc ''colours'' and imho this is an example of what they mean, I can easily see this sitting with a ribbon next to it. The angle used is inspired and I''m constantly drawn to the end of the pier then up to the sun down the rails and ready to start again with the left hand rails keeping me in the frame. The light on the floorboards is fantastic. ok, am starting to ramble, good luck (bumping up 1)', '2006-05-28 15:23:55.000000', NULL, 1),
