(2464613, 337392, 3102, '<td valign="top">"Strikingly" beautiful!  :)  The colors are incredible, and the sharpness is supurb.  I''ll be surprised if this isn''t somewhere at the top of the pack.</td>', '"Strikingly" beautiful!  :)  The colors are incredible, and the sharpness is supurb.  I''ll be surprised if this isn''t somewhere at the top of the pack.', '2006-05-28 23:51:35.000000', NULL, 1),
