(2464621, 337273, 3102, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid you probably turned a perfectly nice shot into a scary hallucination.  I''m just not fond of the color tweaks you''ve done here.</td>', 'I''m afraid you probably turned a perfectly nice shot into a scary hallucination.  I''m just not fond of the color tweaks you''ve done here.', '2006-05-28 23:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464623, 337429, 3102, '<td valign="top">It doesn''t really convey "heat" to me for starters.  Unfortunately, she also looks very disinterested, and isn''t in the best of focus.  It just seems a little uninspired to me.</td>', 'It doesn''t really convey "heat" to me for starters.  Unfortunately, she also looks very disinterested, and isn''t in the best of focus.  It just seems a little uninspired to me.', '2006-05-28 23:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464628, 337411, 3102, '<td valign="top">Sssmokin'', indeed!  I have to admit that I envy people who have models willing to do stuff like this :)</td>', 'Sssmokin'', indeed!  I have to admit that I envy people who have models willing to do stuff like this :)', '2006-05-28 23:55:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464632, 336440, 3102, '<td valign="top">Super shot!  She''s a stunning-looking girl, and the sweat is enough to make this meet the challenge nicely.  I really like her reflection here, too.  Very nice.</td>', 'Super shot!  She''s a stunning-looking girl, and the sweat is enough to make this meet the challenge nicely.  I really like her reflection here, too.  Very nice.', '2006-05-28 23:56:34.000000', NULL, 1),
