(2464684, 337394, 50695, '<td valign="top">my favorite of the whole challenge. That guy looks so familiar, like the star of a 70s detective movie maybe. He looks hot in every sense of the word. And whoever these guys are staring at has some serious heat on him. 10</td>', 'my favorite of the whole challenge. That guy looks so familiar, like the star of a 70s detective movie maybe. He looks hot in every sense of the word. And whoever these guys are staring at has some serious heat on him. 10', '2006-05-29 00:22:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464705, 336831, 50695, '<td valign="top">I assume it''s some sort of toy house judging by the size of the flames, but the effect is still startling and dramatic. You did a really good job of placing it in a background that makes it look like a real house. The overall effect is a Surreal nightmare. 9</td>', 'I assume it''s some sort of toy house judging by the size of the flames, but the effect is still startling and dramatic. You did a really good job of placing it in a background that makes it look like a real house. The overall effect is a Surreal nightmare. 9', '2006-05-29 00:34:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464708, 337453, 50695, '<td valign="top">colorful and vivid.</td>', 'colorful and vivid.', '2006-05-29 00:36:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2464720, 335737, 50695, '<td valign="top">I like the cross formation and how you''ve centered it. It creates a structure, a sense of order, on top of the burning chaos. And a nice capture of white ashes, which I''ve always found to be beautiful. 8</td>', 'I like the cross formation and how you''ve centered it. It creates a structure, a sense of order, on top of the burning chaos. And a nice capture of white ashes, which I''ve always found to be beautiful. 8', '2006-05-29 00:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
