(2465206, 335500, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hey Margie -<br/> <br/>I am actually surprised this scored so low. I don''t normally divulge what I scored any image, but seriously? I scored this one an 8. I thought it was a fantastic depiction of heat. The girl''s expression is perfect, the suspended water is great. I even like the off-center crop. The light is a bit harsh, and that was just about all I had to criticize here. Perhaps a bit of Unsharp Mask might punch this up a bit?</td>', 'Hey Margie - I am actually surprised this scored so low. I don''t normally divulge what I scored any image, but seriously? I scored this one an 8. I thought it was a fantastic depiction of heat. The girl''s expression is perfect, the suspended water is great. I even like the off-center crop. The light is a bit harsh, and that was just about all I had to criticize here. Perhaps a bit of Unsharp Mask might punch this up a bit?', '2006-05-29 02:56:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2465230, 337429, 55642, '<td valign="top">Hi Gunnar -<br/> <br/>I think this mainly suffered from the coat and ski cap, which are cold weather items. The heat is in her cheeks as you say, but that is secondary behind the coat and hat. The focus is a bit too soft, and nothing else in the photo suggests heat. I think it''s a little too much like a snapshot for DPC.</td>', 'Hi Gunnar - I think this mainly suffered from the coat and ski cap, which are cold weather items. The heat is in her cheeks as you say, but that is secondary behind the coat and hat. The focus is a bit too soft, and nothing else in the photo suggests heat. I think it''s a little too much like a snapshot for DPC.', '2006-05-29 03:05:52.000000', NULL, 0),
