(2466336, 337152, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>OK, I gotta admit that I still don''t know what this is.  That aside, I like how the blue forms sort of parenthesis around the smoldering part, and the colors are not only complementary (past challenges just keep coming back, don''t they?) but well presented.  Whatever you did to remove background noise worked well - it''s very black and smooth.  Now, what is it?  :)</td>', 'Trading Post commentOK, I gotta admit that I still don''t know what this is.  That aside, I like how the blue forms sort of parenthesis around the smoldering part, and the colors are not only complementary (past challenges just keep coming back, don''t they?) but well presented.  Whatever you did to remove background noise worked well - it''s very black and smooth.  Now, what is it?  :)', '2006-05-29 14:20:49.000000', NULL, 0),
