(2466342, 337440, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>Heh - it wasn''t a dumb idea, other than you really shouldn''t burn your foot for the sake of a challenge entry - and it did meet the challenge, plus the title was really quite good... But the blurred foot with the post-processed toenails just was a bit too weird-looking in the end.  Just try to do something a wee bit less dangerous for the next one, OK?  :-)</td>', 'Trading Post commentHeh - it wasn''t a dumb idea, other than you really shouldn''t burn your foot for the sake of a challenge entry - and it did meet the challenge, plus the title was really quite good... But the blurred foot with the post-processed toenails just was a bit too weird-looking in the end.  Just try to do something a wee bit less dangerous for the next one, OK?  :-)', '2006-05-29 14:24:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(2466348, 336486, 30982, '<td valign="top">Trading Post comment<br/>First of all, I''m amazed you didn''t burn yourself.  You do know you''re certifiable, right?  I think this was a pretty good execution of your idea.  I realize since you were behind the viewfinder holding your hand out front, you couldn''t much change the angle, but I think had you had the hand turned more so that the flame was between the thumb and first finger for the viewer, it might have been more effective.  Though I don''t know why I think that.  The only other nit - flame doesn''t seem to be as crisply focused as it could be.<br/> <br/>Edit to add I love Aimee''s comment.  <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-29 13:29:56.</i></td>', 'Trading Post commentFirst of all, I''m amazed you didn''t burn yourself.  You do know you''re certifiable, right?  I think this was a pretty good execution of your idea.  I realize since you were behind the viewfinder holding your hand out front, you couldn''t much change the angle, but I think had you had the hand turned more so that the flame was between the thumb and first finger for the viewer, it might have been more effective.  Though I don''t know why I think that.  The only other nit - flame doesn''t seem to be as crisply focused as it could be. Edit to add I love Aimee''s comment.  ', '2006-05-29 14:29:30.000000', '2006-05-29 14:29:56.000000', 0),
(2466356, 337336, 37893, '<td valign="top">Now this is what I call a "hyper-processed" image mate :) Great job!</td>', 'Now this is what I call a "hyper-processed" image mate :) Great job!', '2006-05-29 14:34:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(2466374, 337421, 50231, '<td valign="top">You ROCK Jen! This is AWESOME! Congats on your ribbon. :-)</td>', 'You ROCK Jen! This is AWESOME! Congats on your ribbon. :-)', '2006-05-29 14:43:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(2466377, 337392, 17215, '<td valign="top">Nice image!! I''ve tried stuff like this before without success. I''d love to see a tutorial on this!</td>', 'Nice image!! I''ve tried stuff like this before without success. I''d love to see a tutorial on this!', '2006-05-29 14:44:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2466389, 337440, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>I''m sorry to say, but this is a horrible picture ;)<br/> <br/>the foot is moved due to very slow shutterspeed, and those toenails are hidious, probably due to oversharpening, they look like painted in the picture.<br/> <br/>compaired to your other challenge entries this one hopefully will be forgotten soon :)</td>', '[[trading post]] I''m sorry to say, but this is a horrible picture ;) the foot is moved due to very slow shutterspeed, and those toenails are hidious, probably due to oversharpening, they look like painted in the picture. compaired to your other challenge entries this one hopefully will be forgotten soon :)', '2006-05-29 14:51:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2466391, 337421, 38127, '<td valign="top">YAY Jen!!!!!!!!!!  <br/> <br/>Congrats on the ribbon and the insanity that created it ;)  <br/>Yer neighbours are likely jellis of the heat you n your hubby come up with :P~  <br/>Being Nuts is underrated in my opinion!! <br/>:)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-05-29 13:53:30.</i></td>', 'YAY Jen!!!!!!!!!!   Congrats on the ribbon and the insanity that created it ;)  Yer neighbours are likely jellis of the heat you n your hubby come up with :P~  Being Nuts is underrated in my opinion!! :)', '2006-05-29 14:53:04.000000', '2006-05-29 14:53:30.000000', 0);
