(2468024, 336252, 27482, '<td valign="top">Pretty cool shot!  The crystal really looks like it´s on fire, nice job on lighting it, for obvious reasons this isn´t very believable as magma as the dude in the photo would have melted if it were, would have been so though if he were wearing a superman costume :)  <br/> <br/>Anyway, really like the shot and I am surprised it didn´t score better, I honestly think this is underrated.  The only thing I can think of that I dislike is that it´s a bit tightly composed for my taste, would have liked to see a slightly wider shot but not by much, just to give it some more breathing space towards the top and left side.  Lighting is good, it´s an interesting picture, fits the challenge and I would have rated this a 7 or even an 8 depending how I would have rated this to the rest of the challenge (I was in this challenge too and normally don´t vote on challenges I am in, with a few exceptions ofcourse)</td>', 'Pretty cool shot!  The crystal really looks like it´s on fire, nice job on lighting it, for obvious reasons this isn´t very believable as magma as the dude in the photo would have melted if it were, would have been so though if he were wearing a superman costume :)   Anyway, really like the shot and I am surprised it didn´t score better, I honestly think this is underrated.  The only thing I can think of that I dislike is that it´s a bit tightly composed for my taste, would have liked to see a slightly wider shot but not by much, just to give it some more breathing space towards the top and left side.  Lighting is good, it´s an interesting picture, fits the challenge and I would have rated this a 7 or even an 8 depending how I would have rated this to the rest of the challenge (I was in this challenge too and normally don´t vote on challenges I am in, with a few exceptions ofcourse)', '2006-05-30 07:37:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(2468082, 336789, 52467, '<td valign="top">Well done on 5th place..Cool photo!</td>', 'Well done on 5th place..Cool photo!', '2006-05-30 08:45:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2468100, 337507, 40376, '<td valign="top">No offence to the blue ribbon winner, but putting the 2 shots side to side, how can the winning photo emphasize heat by using a neutral white background while this one with a much more powerful representation comes in 16th ??? :-\<br/>In my eyes this says " Heat " to me so much more.<br/>Great photo and nicely done !</td>', 'No offence to the blue ribbon winner, but putting the 2 shots side to side, how can the winning photo emphasize heat by using a neutral white background while this one with a much more powerful representation comes in 16th ??? :-\In my eyes this says " Heat " to me so much more.Great photo and nicely done !', '2006-05-30 09:01:01.000000', NULL, 0),
