(2469746, 337152, 53164, '<td valign="top">hello again.<br/> <br/>this is a nice image.   not sure that it conveys heat well.  i mean to say, it is difficult to actually see what it is.<br/> <br/>so you got the flame and this "stuff" in it.  but that is all i see. the image itself is great (in my opinion) but it seems to not "fit" the challenge well.<br/> <br/>maybe.</td>', 'hello again. this is a nice image.   not sure that it conveys heat well.  i mean to say, it is difficult to actually see what it is. so you got the flame and this "stuff" in it.  but that is all i see. the image itself is great (in my opinion) but it seems to not "fit" the challenge well. maybe.', '2006-05-30 22:44:13.000000', NULL, 0),
