(2551096, 337152, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>even though it does meet the challenge, it''s really not something that catches the eye.<br/> <br/>it''s really well lit, but the soft colors and low light makes this unfortunately rather boring.<br/> <br/>the composition is good, but I think it would have helped to show some part of the lamp so people would know what they were looking at.<br/> <br/></td>', '[[trading post]] even though it does meet the challenge, it''s really not something that catches the eye. it''s really well lit, but the soft colors and low light makes this unfortunately rather boring. the composition is good, but I think it would have helped to show some part of the lamp so people would know what they were looking at. ', '2006-06-25 09:14:57.000000', NULL, 0),
